sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant A as Grant agents / central / member [E]
participant P as Paperclip / human review [E]
participant T as Grant adapter / PLANNED [P]
participant F as Funding service / DAO schema: P [E]
participant G as Packet core [I]
participant V as DAO vote / Vocdoni [E]
A-->>F: Scoped skill / CLI / MCP: evidence + draft proposals
A-->>P: Task documents + questions + review requests
Note over A,P: Same harness; task-authorized inputs<br/>No shared database or admin token<br/>No portal credentials for members
P-->>T: Authenticated human-only verdict / role confirmation<br/>Addressed reviewer + current document revision
Note over T,F: PLANNED: actor · scope · configured role<br/>Addressee · workspace / packet revision<br/>Exact artifact checks
T-->>F: Apply existing review / signoff operations<br/>Interaction + item + proposal/version/action
F-->>G: Trusted consistent domain read + exact artifact bytes [P]
Note over F,G: Freeze direct-application packet [I]<br/>Exact artifacts + review references<br/>Native revision alone does not verify bytes
G-->>V: Exact packet hash + authorize_manual_submission [P]
V-->>G: Verifier: network · proposal · action · exact packet<br/>Effective final result / finality [P]
G-->>F: Fresh source / packet / review check before acceptance [P]
Note over A,V: Native task / board approval ≠ DAO ratification · changed packet / reviews require a new vote<br/>External submission stays an authorized human handoff; record completion only
